\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {F1--F2: where the interior lowers output error.} Mixed allocator and eviction endpoint both use lagged information; exact recomputation scores both. \textbf  {(a)} The tier-extinction coordinate $D_2$ orders hindsight portfolio gain $G_{+}$ across 25 cells; arrows show increasing context. \textbf  {(b)} Context moves each fixed model across predeclared output-error bands. Error bars are 90\% layer-cluster intervals. Thresholds are not universal across architectures.}}{5}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
